<title>UK: Rheinische Hypo adds 300 mln marks to 10-yr bond. [CORRECTED 16:49 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rheinische Hypo adds 300 mln marks to 10-yr bond. [CORRECTED 16:49 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate issue has been increased to 500 million marks from 200 million marks, lead manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.60     MATURITY    28.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> (Commerzbank corrects pay date from 5/2/97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    FFM	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST COUPON, THEN LINKED TO REX 10-YEAR YIELD</p>
<p>		 SUBINDEX TIMES 81 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
